    "credential_plugin_deadline_limit": "A two-second exec credential plugin makes a one-second context expire only after the plugin returns. This is the existing client-go exec.Command/cmd.Run behavior, not a nettest classifier regression. No Deployment POST occurs. Context bounds context-aware HTTP/throttle/retry work but cannot cancel arbitrary credential plugins."
  },
  "limits": "Empty JSON/proxy substitution is a concrete fail-open fixture counterexample; no normal supported Kubernetes/OpenShift APIserver is shown to emit these nonconforming discovery responses. Valid typed empty APIGroupList remains accepted by the final regression."
